            "review_title": "Review at India Special Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Pietro Franchi\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4 contributions\n1\nAmazing Indian food!\nMay 2020\nI'm an Indian food lover,and this restaurant really worth a visit.\nThe curries are always coked to perfection ,and served in a cosy and pleasant atmosphere.One of strong points of the restaurant is the service : waiters are so friendly and professional, so I often visit Spice India for lunch or dinner ...to feel at home.\nThe restaurant is located in Tan Binh district,not far from the airport ,and hey have free and reliable delivery service .Definitely Spice India place worth your visit!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 18, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
